            icon: "arcforge:cracking_unit_controller",
            description: [
                "A 3×3×5 of Cracking Unit Casings (steel and nickel plates, Wrought Fluid Tank) and a Controller. Catalytic mode (Cracking Catalyst: clay, sand and Nickel Dust, 50 batches) breaks Heavy Oil into Naphtha, Diesel, Refinery Gas and Light Oil at 480°C. Hydrocracking adds Hydrogen for Diesel and Kerosene at 520°C.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:cracking_unit_casing}, {item:arcforge:cracking_unit_controller}, {item:arcforge:cracking_catalyst}"
